Package: orangepi5pro-vendor-drivers
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: orangepi5pro-vendor-drivers
Depends: dkms, linux-headers-current-rockchip64 | linux-headers-edge-rockchip64
Description: Rockchip's MPP, RGA3 and NPU drivers for the Orange Pi 5 Pro
 For Armbian's own kernel: the drivers as DKMS modules, device tree overlays for
 Armbian's DTB, a udev rule for the video and render groups, and a blacklist
 for mainline's decoder and NPU drivers.
